          {
            "title": "Using numbers",
            "id": 126240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nama variabel juga dapat berisi <strong>angka</strong>. Menambahkan angka berguna untuk beberapa variabel yang serupa. Mari buat variabel <code>car1</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car1\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1 car\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>car1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Giving a variable a value",
            "id": 126241,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah membuat dan memberi nama variabel, kita menggunakan tanda <code>=</code> untuk menyimpan <strong>nilai</strong> di dalamnya. Contohnya, <code>let city = \"Chicago\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" city = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chicago&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Chicago\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "String",
            "id": 126243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai yang selama ini kita simpan seperti <code>\"Chicago\"</code> adalah <strong>string</strong>. String adalah kata-kata yang diapit tanda kutip ganda.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Chicago&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Sentence",
            "id": 126244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>String dapat berisi berbagai macam huruf dan simbol, termasuk spasi. Contohnya, <code>\"Winter is coming.\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Winter is coming.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Winter is coming.</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 126245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa nilai konstanta ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Karin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Karin\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>name</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Karin\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
