        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita sudah tahu bahwa kita bisa mendeklarasikan variabel dengan <code>var</code> dan <code>let</code>. Mari cari tahu perbedaan di antara keduanya!</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Const",
            "id": 126254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan <code>let</code> untuk mendeklarasikan variabel yang nilainya tidak seharusnya berubah.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" norwayCapital = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Oslo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>, diikuti oleh <code>norwayCapital</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "const update",
            "id": 126255,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita mencoba memperbarui nilai yang disimpan dalam variabel <code>let</code>, kita akan mendapatkan error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"91\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"error: cannot assign to value: 'age' is a 'let' constant\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Let vs const update",
            "id": 126256,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Namun, kita dapat memperbarui variabel <code>var</code> dengan operator assignment <code>=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"91\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>var</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Default const",
            "id": 126259,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>let</code> dan <code>var</code> sama-sama merupakan variabel yang berguna, dan kita bisa menggunakannya secara bergantian. Namun, sebaiknya kita menggunakan <code>let</code> secara default.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" middleName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Francesca&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
