            "id": 126267,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Baris kode adalah <strong>instruksi</strong> untuk diikuti komputer.</p><p>Saat kita menjalankan code, kita memberi tahu komputer untuk mengikuti instruksi yang kita susun.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Order",
            "id": 126268,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Urutan instruksi penting karena komputer mengikuti instruksi baris demi baris.</p><p>Buat <code>step1</code>, lalu <code>step2</code>, dan kemudian <code>step3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect pants&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Profit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let step1 = \"Collect pants\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>let step2 = \"?\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>let step3 = \"Profit\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Console",
            "id": 126269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan instruksi khusus <code>print()</code>, kita memberi tahu komputer untuk menampilkan sebuah nilai di area yang disebut <strong>konsol</strong>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Hello, World!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying multiple times",
            "id": 126270,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan instruksi <code>print()</code> sesering yang kita mau. Komputer menampilkan setiap nilai pada satu baris di konsol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3, 2, 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GO!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3, 2, 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"GO!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying variables",
            "id": 126271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga bisa menggunakan <code>print()</code> untuk menampilkan variabel seperti <code>greeting</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(greeting)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>greeting</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Output",
            "id": 126272,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita menampilkan variabel di konsol, nilainya akan muncul, bukan namanya. Jika kita mencatat <code>name</code> di sini, nilainya akan ditampilkan.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Daenerys&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Daenerys&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Daenerys\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
